book[4,2]=" |n|n|n|n|n The Rustbeaks|nof|nQuornem|p|n|p Out in the far reaches of Nykra is one of the oldest planets, Quornem. It was home to the Ptalin beings; makers of reality bending technology. Though the planet has a rich and expansive past, there's a particular creature that captured the hearts of many across Nykra. The rustbeak is a completely docile carnivorous bird that stands as tall as an averge person. As their name suggests, their beak has evolved some form of iron integration; which then naturally rusts over time.|p|pThe unfortunate part of rustbeaks is their tendency to find themselves in situations that, typically, result in them no longer being alive. Many agree that the ever expanding infrastructure of the cities in Quornem did not help the rustbeaks to overcome their behaviours. And so because of this, at the time of writing this small passage, the rustbeaks have been officially announced as 'naturally' extinct. They still exist as clones, but are no where to be found on Quornem as they did - before us destructive beings."
