book[1,2]=" |0Here at the Maldisian Science Facility we study the works of the Ptalin beings. They sent us three things:|n|nThe Origin|n|nThe Boldemo|n|nand The Aenox.|p|1The Ptalin are known for being silent upon visiting, and this has unfortunately caused a lot of confusion as we looked into the devices they gave us.|nThe Origin is this large structure placed in the glade out the back of this facility. Like the other two objects, it's made of a dark metallic stone-like material. Upon inspection, we later found that it is made from an element that we have never synthesised to this date. As far as we know, The Origin does not have a direct purpose. The Boldemo and the Aenox are two things that we were warned of, though.|nThe Boldemo is capable of relocating any object smaller than it to another Boldemo anywhere in the galaxy - or so we're told by the Ptalin. We were also told that only “Children of Nenox” were capable of activating it.|nNo Maldisian on this planet has been able to, so we've presumed none of us are a “Child of Nenox”.|nThe Aenox is a small cube that can fit in your hand. It was given to us in a large box, but before we opened it we were warned that we could not touch it. Against the words of the Ptalin, one of our scientists opened the container and grabbed the Aenox cube. Immediately, their hand vaporised. And from that point, all individuals must not open the container under any circumstances.|nSome researchers suggest the situation might be the same as the Boldemo: only the “Children of Nenox” may use it. Though that might be the case, we did find that it heats up when exposed to element 126. We have made a few weighted boxes lined with element 126, that we hope to one day test the Aenox on. When more information arises, we will update the documents.|p|p|p|p|p|p|p|2"
